        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6550 Mortise Georgetown Entry Set with 5000 Half-Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>Baldwin's Georgetown Entry Set evokes the rustic charm of the old world with its bold design. Every detail from the old-fashioned looking thumbturn to the time-honored 5000 Half-Round Knob is seemingly styled with period style homes in mind; but just like what you've come to expect from Baldwin made hardware, it is backed by a limited lifetime mechanical warranty, thus insuring that even though this entrance set looks antique, the workmanship and materials are all built to last. The 6550 Estate Georgetown Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\" as a single cylinder or a dummy set function.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/classic-2-inch-knobset-baldwin-5000\"><b>Baldwin Half-Round Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6550 Georgetown Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estate Collection Georgetown Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5000 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Thickness: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 3.156\"</li>\r\n<li>5000 Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6550.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors. Full Dummy Sets include interior  escutcheon with stationary knob as well as stationary knob on exterior. No blank cylinder. </li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-2-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"250\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\"></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/handlesets\">Door Handlesets</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Georgetown Mortise Entryset, Baldwin 6550",
                "description": "Baldwin 6550 Georgetown Estate  Entrance Set - Baldwin's Georgetown Entry Set evokes the rustic charm of the old world with its bold design. Every detail from the old-fashioned looking thumbturn to the time-honored 5000 Half-Round Knob is seemingly styled with period style homes in mind; but just like what you've come to expect from Baldwin made hardware, it is backed by a limited lifetime mechanical warranty, thus insuring that even though this entrance set looks antique, the workmanship and materials are all built to last. It is available in distressed oil rubbed bronze, distressed venetian bronze, and distressed antique finishes. The 6550 Estate Georgetown Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches as a single cylinder or a dummy set function.",
                "keywords": "baldwin 6550, BAL-6550, bladwin Georgetown entrance sets, baldwin Georgetown entrysets, square entry sets, traditional entry sets, solid brass entrysets, mortise entrysets, mortise entrance sets, mortise handlesets, single cylinder entrance sets, traditional front door hardware, baldwin estate collection entry sets, baldwin estates collection entrance sets, old world door hardware,"
